ent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5 stable\n- Windows 10\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7400 CPU @ 3.00GHz (4 threads) - 31.88 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI can't find refactoring options like JetBrains, so I use Ctrl+R, to replace a variable naming. Hit the down arrow button to find the first location and it shows up nicely, highlighted bright cyan. Then I hit the replace button and subsequent occurrences are less obvious. It doesn't look so bad in the example video because the signal to noise ratio, but the video does demonstrate that the last match, on line 193, is not, as I imagined, obscured by text boxes, but just isn't scrolled to.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1c7536b7-ea7a-46f3-a154-5c66e7de9718\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAs per video, replace multiple.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nvar c = DBL_GRID_W\n\nfunc foobar():\n\tprint(DBL_GRID_W)\n\n\n\n\n\tvar c2 = DBL_GRID_W + 2\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\tprint(DBL_GRID_W)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/user